<title>AUSTRALIA: Port conditions update - Australia - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Australia - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>MELBOURNE, Oct 8 - Patrick employees will hold a stopwork meeting on dayshift Wednesday, Oct 9. There will be no work from 2300, Oct 8, until 1400, Oct 9, so midnight workers can attend meeting. The meeting is in respect of the company's proposed enterprise agreement.</p>
</text>
